For all of you who attended in Chicago, thanks for your participation!
I was pretty happy with how things went, we'd like to know what you
think!

While your memory is fresh, I'd appreciate if you could send your
thoughts of what went well this year, and what we could do better.

How did the core day go?  If you attended a workshop, which workshop
did you participate in, and what did you think about its usefulness?
How did the unconference track and "open day" technical sessions work
for you?

Thanks,

						- Ted
